---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="simple-page">
    <h1>About Orlisse Living</h1>

    <p>
      Orlisse Living is a modern lifestyle publication covering fashion, beauty, travel,
      home & garden, and consumer technology. We believe these aren't separate interests —
      they're interconnected facets of one elevated, intentional life.
    </p>

    <h2>What We Do</h2>
    <p>
      We test products, visit destinations, interview experts, and write deeply researched
      guides to help you make informed choices — whether you're updating your wardrobe,
      building a skincare routine, planning a trip, upgrading your home, or finding the
      right tech for your space.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Approach</h2>
    <p>
      Every recommendation on this site is based on firsthand testing, expert interviews,
      and thorough research. We never accept payment for coverage. When we recommend
      something, it's because we genuinely believe it's worth your attention and money.
    </p>

    <h2 id="authors">Authors</h2>
    <p>
      Our contributors bring deep expertise from their respective fields — fashion editors,
      licensed estheticians, travel journalists, interior designers, and tech reviewers.
      Each article clearly identifies its author, and you can always check their credentials
      and background.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
